                                   QUERY PLAN                                   
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Seq Scan on public.jittest_simple
   Project: tableoid; JIT-Expr: evalexpr_0_0
 JIT:
   Functions: 1 (1 for expression evaluation)
   Options: Inlining false, Optimization true, Expressions true, Deforming true
(5 rows)

COMMIT;
